    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that. the breathing and stuff. but it doesn't help. staring at my hands just makes me feel more like i'm observing a character in a game or something. it's like i'm just an observer of a life that isn't really happening. i don't think \"stepping back\" is going to change the fact that there's no real \"me\" to step back. it just feels... empty. like something is missing that can't be fixed.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
